<view class="page wardrobe-page">
  <view class="page-header wardrobe-heading"><view class="wardrobe-eyebrow">人生时光机 · 衣着篇</view><view class="page-title">一生衣橱</view><view class="wardrobe-subtitle">岁月有迹，衣着有新。</view><view class="muted">为这张 {{targetAge}} 岁的照片选一个系列，收下整套新衣着。</view><view class="wardrobe-count">{{priceSeries}} / 系列 · 包含全部可用款式</view></view>
  <view class="wardrobe-comparison" wx:if="{{sourcePath || resultPath}}">
    <view class="wardrobe-frame"><image wx:if="{{sourcePath}}" class="wardrobe-photo" src="{{sourcePath}}" mode="aspectFit" aria-label="换装前原年龄照片" /><view class="frame-caption">原年龄照片</view></view>
    <view class="wardrobe-frame" wx:if="{{commandId}}"><image wx:if="{{resultPath}}" class="wardrobe-photo" src="{{resultPath}}" mode="aspectFit" aria-label="{{targetAge}}岁换装结果，AI生成照片" /><view class="wardrobe-photo waiting-photo" wx:else><view>{{result.status === 'failed' ? '换装未完成' : result.status === 'review' ? '照片需要复核' : result.status === 'reconciliation_required' ? '结果待核对' : '正在换装'}}</view><text>原片不会被覆盖</text></view><view class="frame-caption">换装照片 · {{targetAge}} 岁</view></view>
  </view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{context && referenceEnabled}}">
    <view class="section-title">自定义图片模板</view>
    <view class="muted wardrobe-tip">保存一张服装参考图，与原年龄照片对照。参考图只保存在此设备，当前仅用于预览。</view>
    <image wx:if="{{customTemplatePath}}" class="wardrobe-photo" src="{{customTemplatePath}}" mode="aspectFit" aria-label="自定义服装参考图" />
    <button class="button secondary" bindtap="chooseCustomTemplate" disabled="{{busy || choosingTemplate}}">{{choosingTemplate ? '正在选择图片' : customTemplatePath ? '更换参考图' : '从相册选择参考图'}}</button>
    <button wx:if="{{customTemplatePath}}" class="button ghost" bindtap="deleteCustomTemplate" disabled="{{busy || choosingTemplate}}">删除参考图</button>
    <view wx:if="{{templateError}}" class="status error" role="alert">{{templateError}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{context}}">
    <view class="section-title">{{context.catalogVersion === 'lifetime-wardrobe.v5' ? '经典影视套装' : context.catalogVersion === 'lifetime-wardrobe.v4' ? '奇幻英雄服' : '这一岁，想穿什么'}}</view>
    <view class="muted wardrobe-tip">{{context.catalogVersion === 'lifetime-wardrobe.v5' ? '从同题材的男装或女装选一套，每套九款。' : context.catalogVersion === 'lifetime-wardrobe.v4' ? '公主和王子共享同阵营纹样，每套有九种造型。换装保留人物、年龄与构图。' : '只更换衣着，保留人物、年龄与构图。幼年使用适龄款式；纪念系列会标明适用范围。'}}</view>
    <button wx:if="{{!purchaseId && !commandId}}" class="button secondary compact" bindtap="switchCollection" disabled="{{busy}}">{{context.catalogVersion === 'lifetime-wardrobe.v5' ? '看看奇幻英雄服' : '看看经典影视套装'}}</button>
    <view class="wardrobe-discovery-count">{{series.length}} 个系列 · {{styleCount}} 款衣着<text>本照片可选 {{availableSeriesCount}} 个系列</text></view>
    <view class="wardrobe-search"><input value="{{seriesQuery}}" bindinput="searchSeries" maxlength="40" placeholder="{{context.catalogVersion === 'lifetime-wardrobe.v5' ? '搜题材或款式，如「西部」' : context.catalogVersion === 'lifetime-wardrobe.v4' ? '搜王国、职业或款式，如「骑士」' : '搜系列、款式或面料，如「软呢」'}}" aria-label="搜索衣橱系列、款式或面料" confirm-type="search" /></view>
    <scroll-view class="category-scroll" scroll-x="{{true}}"><view class="category-options"><button wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="id" class="category-option {{categoryId === item.id ? 'active' : ''}}" data-category="{{item.id}}" bindtap="filterCategory" aria-label="{{item.label}}分类">{{item.label}}</button></view></scroll-view>
    <view class="wardrobe-filter"><text>只看这张照片能用的系列</text><switch checked="{{onlyAvailable}}" bindchange="filterAvailable" color="#805B72" aria-label="只看当前照片可用系列" /></view>
    <view class="series-options {{visibleSeries.length === 1 ? 'single-result' : ''}}">
      <button wx:for="{{visibleSeries}}" wx:for-item="seriesItem" wx:key="id" class="series-option {{selectedSeriesId === seriesItem.id ? 'active' : ''}}" data-series="{{seriesItem.id}}" bindtap="selectBundle" disabled="{{busy || !seriesItem.count}}" aria-label="{{seriesItem.label}}，{{seriesItem.availability}}，{{selectedSeriesId === seriesItem.id ? '已选中' : '选择此系列'}}">
        <view class="series-cover" style="{{seriesItem.coverStyle}}" aria-hidden="true">
          <view class="series-lead wardrobe-image"><image src="{{seriesItem.coverLooks[0].previewSrc}}" mode="aspectFit" lazy-load="{{true}}" webp="{{true}}" /></view>
          <view class="series-companions">
            <block wx:for="{{seriesItem.coverLooks}}" wx:for-item="look" wx:key="id">
              <view class="wardrobe-image" wx:if="{{index > 0}}"><image src="{{look.previewSrc}}" mode="aspectFit" lazy-load="{{true}}" webp="{{true}}" /></view>
            </block>
          </view>
          <text class="series-selected" wx:if="{{selectedSeriesId === seriesItem.id}}">已选</text>
        </view>
        <view class="series-copy"><view class="series-category">{{seriesItem.categoryLabel}} · {{seriesItem.totalCount}} 款</view><view class="series-name">{{seriesItem.label}}</view><view class="series-tagline">{{seriesItem.tagline}}</view><view class="series-looks">{{seriesItem.lookNames}}</view><view class="series-availability">{{seriesItem.availability}}<text wx:if="{{seriesItem.count}}"> · {{retailPriceSeries}}</text></view></view>
      </button>
    </view>
    <view class="discovery-empty" wx:if="{{!visibleSeries.length}}"><view>暂时没有匹配的系列</view><button class="button secondary" bindtap="clearDiscovery">查看全部系列</button></view>
    <view class="palette-caption">AI 衣着预览 · 点击款式查看面料与剪裁</view>
    <view id="wardrobe-template-grid" class="selected-series" wx:if="{{selectedSeries}}"><view class="section-title">已选 · {{selectedSeries.label}}</view><view class="muted">{{selectedSeries.tagline}}</view><view class="outfit-selection">这一套包含 {{bundleCount}} 款衣着，总价 {{priceSeries}}，不逐款计费。</view></view>
    <view class="template-grid-heading"><text>{{seriesPurchase ? '这笔订单的款式' : '这一套的九款衣着'}}</text><text>{{bundleCount}} 款适用 · 整套 {{priceSeries}}</text></view>
    <view class="template-grid">
      <button class="template-tile {{focusedTemplate.id === item.id ? 'focused' : ''}} {{item.available ? '' : 'unavailable'}}" wx:for="{{templateStyles}}" wx:key="id" data-style="{{item.id}}" bindtap="previewOutfit" disabled="{{busy || !item.available}}" aria-label="{{item.ordinal}} {{item.label}}，{{item.available ? '查看衣着细节' : item.unavailableReason}}，{{focusedTemplate.id === item.id ? '当前预览' : ''}}">
        <view class="template-tile-art wardrobe-image"><image src="{{item.previewSrc}}" mode="aspectFit" lazy-load="{{true}}" webp="{{true}}" aria-hidden="true" /></view>
        <view class="template-tile-name">{{item.label}}</view><view class="template-tile-status">{{!item.available ? item.unavailableReason : focusedTemplate.id === item.id ? '当前款式' : '查看细节'}}</view>
      </button>
    </view>
    <view id="wardrobe-template-detail" class="template-hero" wx:if="{{focusedTemplate}}">
      <view class="template-hero-copy"><view class="template-title">{{focusedTemplate.label}}</view><view class="template-features"><text wx:for="{{focusedTemplate.features}}" wx:for-item="feature" wx:key="*this">{{feature}}</text></view></view>
      <view class="section-head template-navigation" wx:if="{{templatePosition && bundleCount > 1}}">
        <button class="button secondary compact" data-step="previous" bindtap="stepTemplate" disabled="{{busy || templatePosition <= 1}}">上一款</button>
        <text class="muted" aria-label="可用款式第 {{templatePosition}} 款，共 {{bundleCount}} 款">{{templatePosition}} / {{bundleCount}}</text>
        <button class="button secondary compact" data-step="next" bindtap="stepTemplate" disabled="{{busy || templatePosition >= bundleCount}}">下一款</button>
      </view>
      <view class="template-art wardrobe-image"><image src="{{focusedTemplate.previewSrc}}" mode="aspectFit" webp="{{true}}" aria-label="{{focusedTemplate.label}}，AI 衣着预览图" /></view>
      <view class="template-hero-copy"><button class="button secondary" bindtap="showTemplateGrid">返回款式列表</button></view>
    </view>
    <view class="template-scope-note" wx:if="{{!seriesPurchase && bundleCount < templateStyles.length}}">本系列共 {{templateStyles.length}} 款；按当前年龄与人数可生成 {{bundleCount}} 款，不适用款式不会提交。</view>
    <view class="template-scope-note" wx:if="{{seriesPurchase}}">本笔订单保留购买时的 {{seriesPurchase.expectedCount}} 款与原报价，不因目录扩充重复收费。</view>
    <view class="person-outfit" wx:for="{{people}}" wx:for-item="person" wx:key="participantId">
      <view class="section-head"><view class="person-label">{{person.label}}{{person.self ? ' · 本人' : ''}}</view><text class="caption">{{person.authorized ? '已确认换装用途' : '待本人确认'}}</text></view>
      <view class="outfit-selection" wx:if="{{commandId}}">原有照片款式 · {{person.selectedLabel}}</view>
      <button class="button secondary" wx:if="{{!person.self && !person.authorized}}" open-type="share" data-participant="{{person.participantId}}">邀请对方确认换装</button>
    </view>
    <checkbox-group class="consent-panel" bindchange="consentChanged"><label class="row"><checkbox value="accepted" color="#26384a" checked="{{accepted}}" disabled="{{busy}}" /><text>我同意对本原照衍生的年龄照片换装，不含公开分享。可单独撤回；对方需要本人确认。</text></label></checkbox-group>
    <button class="button" disabled="{{busy || !accepted || !sourcePath || !bundleCount}}" bindtap="submit">{{busy ? '正在核对订单' : purchaseId ? '继续这套订单（不重复付款）' : priceSeries + ' · 生成整套 ' + bundleCount + ' 张'}}</button>
    <view class="field-hint">本系列所有适合当前年龄与人数的款式各生成一张，原年龄照片与时间轴会保留。</view>
    <button class="button ghost" wx:if="{{people.length}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="revoke">撤回我对本原照的换装授权</button>
  </view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{seriesPurchase}}">
    <view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">{{seriesPurchase.seriesTitle}}</view><text class="tag">{{seriesPurchase.readyCount}} / {{seriesPurchase.expectedCount}} 张就绪</text></view>
    <view class="muted">整套总价 {{priceSeries}} · 本页已保存 {{seriesSaved}} / {{seriesPurchase.expectedCount}} 张</view>
    <view class="person-outfit" wx:for="{{seriesItems}}" wx:key="itemId">
      <view class="section-title">{{item.title}}</view><image wx:if="{{item.localPath}}" class="wardrobe-photo" src="{{item.localPath}}" mode="aspectFit" aria-label="{{item.title}}换装结果，AI生成照片" />
      <button class="button secondary" wx:if="{{item.status === 'ready'}}" data-item="{{item.itemId}}" bindtap="saveSeries" disabled="{{busy}}">保存这款原图</button>
      <button class="button secondary" wx:elif="{{item.canRetry}}" data-item="{{item.itemId}}" bindtap="retrySeries" disabled="{{busy}}">恢复这款（不另收费）</button>
      <view class="muted" wx:else>{{item.status === 'awaiting_payment' ? '等待付款确认' : item.status === 'unsubmitted' ? '等待继续提交，可使用上方按钮恢复整套订单' : item.status === 'pending' || item.status === 'retrying' ? '正在制作，可以稍后从订单回来查看' : '这款需要核对，暂不重复生成'}}</view>
    </view>
    <button class="button" wx:if="{{seriesPurchase.readyCount}}" bindtap="saveSeries" disabled="{{busy}}">保存所有就绪原图</button>
  </view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{result}}">
    <view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">换装结果</view><text class="tag">{{targetAge}} 岁 · 1 张</text></view>
    <view wx:if="{{result.status === 'ready'}}"><view class="muted">{{result.asset.width}} × {{result.asset.height}} · 原始画质</view><button class="button" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy || !result.downloadPath}}">保存换装原图</button></view>
    <view wx:elif="{{result.canRetry}}"><view class="muted">这次未完成，可以保留原选择恢复。已重试 {{result.attempts}} / 3 次。</view><button class="button" bindtap="retry" disabled="{{busy}}">恢复这张换装照片</button></view>
    <view class="muted" wx:else>{{result.status === 'pending' || result.status === 'retrying' ? '已保存请求，可以稍后从相册继续查看。' : '结果需要核对或复核，暂不重复生成。'}}</view>
  </view>
  <button class="button secondary" wx:if="{{albumPermissionDenied}}" bindtap="albumSettings" disabled="{{busy}}">前往设置，允许保存到相册</button>
  <button class="button secondary" bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{busy}}">{{busy ? '正在处理' : '刷新授权与结果'}}</button>
  <button class="button secondary" bindtap="library">返回相册</button>
  <view class="status error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="status" wx:if="{{message}}">{{message}}</view>
  <view class="privacy-foot">换装照片保留 AI 生成标识。离开页面会清理临时图片；保存和下载会再次校验授权。</view>
</view>
